---
import { Container } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
	title: 'HyperClose | tevsys',
	description: 'Descubre cómo HyperClose ejecuta cierres en milisegundos cuando se intenta operar estando bloqueado.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
	<Container>
		<section class="feature-hero">
			<p class="feature-kicker">Feature de protección</p>
			<h1>
				HyperClose: cuando tu disciplina falla,<br />
				HyperClose <span class="feature-title__accent">no.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="feature-hook"><span class="feature-hook__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Cierre en milisegundos. Bloqueo hasta la siguiente rotación (diaria o semanal).</p>
			<p class="feature-lead">
				Si estás bloqueado y aun así intentas operar, HyperClose cierra en milisegundos antes del siguiente tick. Cada intento queda registrado.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="hyperclose-demo" class="feature-demo">
			<h2>Demo rápida (1 min 35 s)</h2>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--compact" id="hyperclose-demo-container">
				<video id="hyperclose-demo-video" controls preload="metadata">
					<source src="/videos/features/hyperclose-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
					Tu navegador no soporta reproducción de video HTML5.
				</video>
			</div>
			<p class="demo-edit-note">Vídeo editado para acortar esperas (cadencia 30 s entre modales).</p>
		</section>

		<section class="feature-proof">
			<h2>Qué puedes comprobar</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#hyperclose-demo">Cierre inmediato en milisegundos.</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#hyperclose-semaphore">Semáforo de responsabilidad (3 niveles).</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#hyperclose-off">Compatibilidad con día OFF.</a></li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section id="hyperclose-close" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>Cierre inmediato</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Ejecución en milisegundos</p>
			<p>Si intentas operar estando bloqueado, el sistema cierra la operación de forma automática e inmediata.</p>
			<p><strong>Cómo validarlo:</strong> Intenta abrir operación en estado bloqueado y verifica cierre inmediato.</p>
			<p>
				<a class="proof-capture-link" href="#hyperclose-demo">
					Ir a demo del cierre <span class="proof-link-meta">VIDEO</span>
				</a>
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="hyperclose-semaphore" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>Semáforo de responsabilidad</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Tres niveles de aviso por reiteración</p>
			<p>El sistema escala mensajes educativos y de responsabilidad según la repetición del intento.</p>
			<p><strong>Cómo validarlo:</strong> Intenta operar varias veces estando bloqueado y observa la secuencia de avisos.</p>
			<p>
				<a class="proof-capture-link" href="#hyperclose-demo">Ir a demo del cierre <span class="proof-link-meta">VIDEO</span></a> — El mismo vídeo muestra los 3 niveles del semáforo.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="hyperclose-off" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>Compatibilidad con día OFF</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Protección activa también en jornada OFF</p>
			<p>Aunque el día esté marcado como OFF, los intentos fuera de regla se detectan y se cierran.</p>
			<p><strong>Cómo validarlo:</strong> Mantén el día en OFF e intenta operar para comprobar que el bloqueo sigue activo.</p>
			<p><a class="proof-capture-link" href="#">Ver evidencia en día OFF</a></p>
		</section>

		<section class="feature-cta">
			<h2>¿Quieres validarlo en tu operativa?</h2>
			<p>Te mostramos HyperClose en contexto real y resolvemos si encaja con tu estilo y nivel de riesgo.</p>
			<a href="/company/contact?feature=hyperclose&flow=demo" class="feature-cta__button">Probar HyperClose en demo</a>
		</section>
	</Container>
</Layout>

<script>
	function playDemoIfTarget() {
		if (window.location.hash !== '#hyperclose-demo') return;
		const video = document.getElementById('hyperclose-demo-video');
		if (video) video.play().catch(() => {});
	}
	function initDemoExpand() {
		const video = document.getElementById('hyperclose-demo-video');
		const container = document.getElementById('hyperclose-demo-container');
		if (!video || !container) return;
		video.addEventListener('play', () => container.classList.add('demo-video--playing'));
		video.addEventListener('ended', () => container.classList.remove('demo-video--playing'));
	}
	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
		playDemoIfTarget();
		initDemoExpand();
	});
	window.addEventListener('hashchange', playDemoIfTarget);
</script>

<style>
	.feature-hero,
	.feature-demo,
	.feature-proof,
	.feature-cta {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
	}
	.feature-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
	}
	.feature-hero h1 {
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.2vw, 2.7rem);
		line-height: 1.08;
		max-width: 26ch;
	}
	.feature-title__accent {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.feature-hook {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 600;
		opacity: 0.9;
		margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
	}
	.feature-hook__dot {
		width: 0.45rem;
		height: 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #f5b041;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.feature-lead {
		max-width: 70ch;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}
	#hyperclose-demo {
		scroll-margin-top: 5.5rem;
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, background-color 0.25s ease;
	}
	#hyperclose-demo:target {
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.55);
		background: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.08);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.25);
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
	}
	.feature-demo h2,
	.feature-proof h2,
	.feature-cta h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
	}
	.demo-video--compact {
		max-width: 420px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
		transition: max-width 0.35s ease;
	}
	.demo-video--compact.demo-video--playing {
		max-width: none;
	}
	.demo-edit-note {
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		opacity: 0.82;
	}
	.demo-placeholder {
		background: var(--theme-surface-1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.28);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
	}
	.demo-video {
		background: #06080d;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.3);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		overflow: hidden;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.demo-video video {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}
	.demo-placeholder p {
		margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.demo-placeholder p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.demo-note {
		opacity: 0.8;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.feature-proof ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
	}
	.feature-proof li {
		margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.evidence-link {
		color: #ffffff;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
		cursor: pointer;
	}
	.evidence-link:hover {
		color: #f5b041;
	}
	.evidence-link:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid #f5b041;
		outline-offset: 3px;
		border-radius: 0.2rem;
	}
	.feature-proof-detail {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		background: var(--theme-surface-1);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
		scroll-margin-top: 5.5rem;
		transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, background-color 0.25s ease;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
	}
	.feature-proof-detail h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.45rem;
	}
	.feature-proof-detail h3::before {
		content: '';
		width: 0.42rem;
		height: 0.42rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #f5b041;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.feature-proof-detail p {
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.feature-proof-subtitle {
		margin: -0.1rem 0 0.5rem !important;
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 600;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.feature-proof-detail:target {
		border-color: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.55);
		background: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.08);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.25);
	}
	.proof-capture-link {
		color: #f5b041;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.proof-capture-link:hover {
		color: #f7c050;
	}
	.proof-capture-link:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid #f5b041;
		outline-offset: 3px;
		border-radius: 0.2rem;
	}
	.proof-link-meta {
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		padding: 0.08rem 0.38rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.55);
		background: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.12);
		color: #f7c050;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}
	.feature-cta {
		background: var(--theme-surface-1);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		padding: 1.2rem;
	}
	.feature-cta p {
		margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.feature-cta__button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
		border-radius: 1.4rem;
		background: #f5b041;
		color: #1a1510;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.feature-cta__button:hover {
		background: #f7c050;
	}
</style>
